      "value": "@{5f1a5a360ab2a046d22bc971|full_name}: what you mentioned is right but it will NEVER lag or crash the user \nto make this easier to understand let us see what are vrchat processes that mainly cause the lag when normally your friend join you (didn't analyze traffic this what my eyes analyzed)\n1- adding number to users in the room \n2- receive that the user joining is your friend\n3- loading name tag\n4- loading blue man model first\n5- receive information about friends avatar \n6- start downloading avatar \n7- after downloading switching blue man to friend's avatar \n8- loading meshes\n9- applying textures \n10- applying shaders\n11-get other things ready from the avatar like audio and animations\n12- applying any rendering or shader that the world force\n13- when you have performance preferences it applies which means it will switch avatar to grey man model\n14- receive every move that your friend do\nCompared to @{5f0c9475215371696d1b6923|full_name} idea :\n1- receive avatar information \n2- download avatar\nso yes this feature will NOT have anything to do with lagging or crashing as avatars will not appear until you meet your friends that is why it is perfect as it will reduce/split the processes running when you meet your friend in today vrchat so highly recommend adding this feature",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
