  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-13T18:32:52.020Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi everyone,\ncan you please vote to add advance options in settings to load friends' avatars when they are online in other worlds or even offline this will help make things a lot faster specially that now there is 5G and fiber internet and who knows how soon we will get to 6G talking about myself I have 1000 Mb/s ( about 120 MB/s) so no matter how much things loading will not slow my internet neither my Monster Pc (I have some friends on vrchat with faster internet)and I don't want vrchat to be less than real life in real life you don't wait for people to load neither vrchat will if this option is added\nand to give the story behind this idea (please share a story happened to you that was going to be better with this idea)\nI was in a very awkward position today as we ( 9 animators) did a challenge everyone made 3 different animation and tried to get as much reaction from people and record it then we all meet and make a showcase for animations to rate it and rate reactions too so I had some amazing models and animations but it looks like it was a little bit bigger than normal so I needed to wait about 5 min and even more with others to just show a single avatar .it took sooooo long to get some reactions :( . I kept thinking of it for the rest of the day until I got this idea so please add it it will help the platform so much.\nThank you",
